   Versions are read from the binaries themselves — "1.52.0" is the version string
   embedded in espeak-ng.dll and "1.2.0" the one embedded in piper.exe.

   eSpeak NG is conveyed in OBJECT FORM. GPL-3.0 §6 therefore requires an offer of the
   corresponding source: it is eSpeak NG 1.52.0, at
